      "supported_claims": [
        "Plugin signatures pre_receive(alert), take_action(alert,action,text,**kwargs), status_change(alert,status,text,**kwargs); exception dispatch inspected in utils/api.py.",
        "Single /action persists action plugin attributes separately before from_action final history save; PostgreSQL helper commits each UPDATE. Atomic capture guarantee covers final UPDATE only.",
        "Default alarm model rejects ack on ack; views returns HTTP409 for InvalidAction.",
        "history is a ten-field composite array, newest first; set_alert replaces attributes; dedup top-level JSONB merges.",
        "Authenticated API key owner label has g.user_id=None; human JWT customer scopes and assignment admin override verified in auth sources."
      ]
