      "supported_claims": [
        "CEvent.php groupids joins any matching trigger host; addRelatedHosts enumerates complete related IDs with nopermissions=true on internal Host.get. Client must compare full approved host set.",
        "CEvent acknowledge ack bit2 only changes unack events; message bit4 adds a message even if already ack. Exactly one event per implementation request.",
        "CJsonRpc processResult echoes request id with result only on success; errors are JSON-RPC bodies, HTTP200 alone is insufficient.",
        "CEvent get supports exact eventids/source/object/value, selectHosts and selectAcknowledges.",
        "CHost get supports selectHostGroups for approved host inventory.",
        "expression.c expands original event, separate recovery, cause and update message macro contexts. get_event_cause_value returns FAIL for an event without a cause event and the substitution loop then emits STR_UNKNOWN_VARIABLE (*UNKNOWN*) for {EVENT.CAUSE.ID} (7.0.10 include/zbx_expression_constants.h); a recovery macro stays unexpanded on a problem event. Observed on the isolated deployment-path lab (SPEC_AMENDMENTS.md A3); actual live operation expansion remains G2/G3.",
        "No bundled Alerta media type found in this source tag; event_driven_ansible is the inspected export-format example.",
        "CMediatype.php get parameters are selected as output field; no selectParameters flag."
      ]
